        The bug was caused by the inability to resize images using the +/- keys in no-scaling mode, particularly when the application was in fullscreen. The original conditions for scaling did not account for fullscreen mode, which led to unexpected behavior when users attempted to resize images without scaling enabled.

        Commit message:
        Make resizing using +/- possible in no-scaling mode

This fixes a bug introduced by ed58a47  

